   "lines": [
    "The coming home",
    "has been much",
    "harder than I",
    "expected; for the",
    "memories are fright=",
    "fully vivid. I",
    "realize now that",
    "the days of un-",
    "alloyed happiness",
    "are now over forever.",
    "But oh how",
    "much I have",
    "left to be thank-",
    "-ful for!",
    "Had a very",
    "pleasant dinner",
    "with Aunt Annie",
    "and Uncle Jimmie."
   ],
